<p>In the early noughties, I did use software called <em>Game Collector</em> to maintain my video game database. To give you an idea how this looked like, I still have an incomplete HTML export published at <a href="https://jefklakscodex.com/gamelist/">https://jefklakscodex.com/gamelist/</a>. Keeping track of the purchase price is also an interesting (and painful) experiment.</p>
<p>Here&rsquo;s an idea: maybe I should build a <code>/backlog</code> endpoint to start tracking new and ongoing games as well&hellip;</p>


          
